        "text_YrENir": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Toit Studio, we believe the things we bring into our homes should feel useful, personal, and worth keeping. Our approach to sustainability begins with thoughtful selection—choosing pieces that balance function, character, and versatility, and can become part of everyday routines long beyond a single season.</p><p>From drinkware and tableware to kitchenware and décor, we look for objects you can enjoy often, style in different ways, and continue using over time. Because a piece that remains useful and loved holds more value than something chosen only for the moment.</p><p>We're not interested in making big promises. We simply believe that better choices, longer use, and a little more consideration can make everyday living feel more meaningful.</p>"
